  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2933,
      "text": "Tā sīn mīm.[1]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2934,
      "text": "These are the verses of the clear Book.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2935,
      "text": "Perhaps you[2] will grieve yourself to death because they do not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2936,
      "text": "If We willed, We could send down upon them a sign from the heaven, at which their necks would stay bowed in humility[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2937,
      "text": "No new reminder comes to them from the Most Compassionate except that they turn away from it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2938,
      "text": "They have rejected [the Truth], soon there will come to them the consequences of their ridicule.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2939,
      "text": "Do they not see the earth, how many fine kinds of plants We grow in it?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2940,
      "text": "Indeed, there is a sign in this, yet most of them will not believe.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2941,
      "text": "Your Lord is indeed the All-Mighty, the Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 316,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2942,
      "text": "And [remember] when your Lord called out to Moses, “Go to the wrongdoing people –",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2943,
      "text": "the people of Pharaoh; will they not fear [the punishment of] Allah?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2944,
      "text": "He said, “My Lord, I fear that they may reject me,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2945,
      "text": "and I will feel distressed and my tongue will not be fluent, so send Aaron along [to help me].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2946,
      "text": "Moreover, they have a charge against me, so I fear they may kill me[4].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2947,
      "text": "Allah said, “Certainly not! Go, both of you, with Our signs[5]; We are with you, listening.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2948,
      "text": "Go to Pharaoh and say, ‘We are the messengers[6] from the Lord of the worlds,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2949,
      "text": "that you let the Children of Israel go with us.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2950,
      "text": "Pharaoh said, “Did we not bring you up as a child among us, and you stayed with us several years of your life?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 19,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 367,
      "ruku": 317,
      "hizbQuarter": 147,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2951,
      "text": "Yet you did what you did[7], and you are extremely ungrateful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 26,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الشُّعَرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Ash-Shu'araa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Poets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 227,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
